800 text-xs font-semibold\">Boğaz (Kalın)</span></td>\n                  <td class=\"py-3 px-4 font-medium text-slate-700\">Boğazın ağza en yakın kısmı</td>\n                  <td class=\"py-3 px-4 text-slate-600\">\"Ğ\" harfinin kalınlaştırılmış hâli gibidir (Ğa).</td>\n                </tr>\n\n                <!-- ف -->\n                <tr data-region=\"dudak\" class=\"hover:bg-slate-50 transition-colors\">\n                  <td class=\"py-3 px-4 text-center font-quran text-2xl font-bold text-emerald-800\">ف</td>\n                  <td class=\"py-3 px-4\"><span class=\"px-2 py-0.5 rounded bg-cyan-100 text-cyan-800 text-xs font-semibold\">Dudak</span></td>\n                  <td class=\"py-3 px-4 font-medium text-slate-700\">Üst ön diş uçlarıyla alt dudağın içi</td>\n                  <td class=\"py-3 px-4 text-slate-600\">\"F\" harfi gibidir.</td>\n                </tr>\n\n                <!-- ق -->\n                <tr data-region=\"dil\" class=\"hover:bg-slate-50 transition-colors\">\n                  <td class=\"py-3 px-4 text-center font-quran text-2xl font-bold text-orange-700\">ق</td>\n                  <td class=\"py-3 px-4\"><span class=\"px-2 py-0.5 rounded bg-emerald-100 text-emerald-800 text-xs font-semibold\">Dil (Kalın)</span></td>\n                  <td class=\"py-3 px-4 font-medium text-slate-700\">Dil kökü ve küçük dil önü</td>\n                  <td class=\"py-3 px-4 text-slate-600\">\"G\" harfinin kalınlaştırılmış hâli gibidir (Ga).</td>\n                </tr>\n\n                <!-- ك -->\n                <tr data-region=\"dil\" class=\"hover:bg-slate-50 transition-colors\">\n                  <td class=\"py-3 px-4 text-center font-quran text-2xl font-bold text-emerald-800\">ك</td>\n                  <td class=\"py-3 px-4\"><span class=\"px-2 py-0.5 rounded bg-emerald-100 text-emerald-800 text-xs font-semibold\">Dil</span></td>\n                  <td class=\"py-3 px-4 font-medium text-slate-700\">Dil kökü ve üst damak ortası</td>\n                  <td class=\"py-3 px-4 text-slate-600\">\"K\" harfi gibidir.</td>\n                </tr>\n\n                <!-- ل -->\n                <tr data-region=\"dil\" class=\"hover:bg-slate-50 transition-colors\">\n                  <td class=\"py-3 px-4 text-center font-quran text-2xl font-bold text-emerald-800\">ل</td>\n                  <td class=\"py-3 px-4\"><span class=\"px-2 py-0.5 rounded bg-emerald-100 text-emerald-800 text-xs font-semibold\">Dil</span></td>\n                  <td class=\"py-3 px-4 font-medium text-slate-700\">Dilin iki kenarı, ucu ve üst damak</td>\n                  <td class=\"py-3 px-4 text-slate-600\">\"L\" harfi gibidir.</td>\n                </tr>\n\n                <!-- م -->\n                <tr data-region=\"dudak\" class=\"hover:bg-slate-50 transition-colors\">\n                  <td class=\"py-3 px-4 text-center font-quran text-2xl font-bold text-emerald-800\">م</td>\n                  <td class=\"py-3 px-4\"><span class=\"px-2 py-0.5 rounded bg-cyan-100 text-cyan-800 text-xs font-semibold\">Dudak</span></td>\n                  <td class=\"py-3 px-4 font-medium text-slate-700\">Alt ve üst dudak</td>\n                  <td class=\"py-3 px-4 text-slate-600\">\"M\" harfi gibidir.</td>\n                </tr>\n\n                <!-- ن -->\n                <tr data-region=\"dil\" class=\"hover:bg-slate-50 transition-colors\">\n                  <td class=\"py-3 px-4 text-center font-quran text-2xl font-bold text-emerald-800\">ن</td>\n                  <td class=\"py-3 px-4\"><span class=\"px-2 py-0.5 rounded bg-emerald-100 text-emerald-800 text-xs font-semibold\">Dil</span></td>\n                  <td class=\"py-3 px-4 font-medium text-slate-700\">Dil ucu ile iki üst ön diş etleri</td>\n                  <td class=\"py-3 px-4 text-slate-600\">\"N\" harfi gibidir.</td>\n                </tr>\n\n                <!-- و -->\n                <tr data-region=\"dudak\" class=\"hover:bg-slate-50 transition-colors\">\n                  <td class=\"py-3 px-4 text-center font-quran text-2xl font-bold text-emerald-800\">و</td>\n                  <td class=\"py-3 px-4\"><span class=\"px-2 py-0.5 rounded bg-cyan-100 text-cyan-800 text-xs font-semibold\">Dudak</span></td>\n                  <td class=\"py-3 px-4 font-medium text-slate-700\">Alt ve üst dudak</td>\n                  <td class=\"py-3 px-4 text-slate-600\">\"V\" harfi gibidir.</td>\n                </tr>\n\n                <!-- ه -->\n                <tr data-region=\"bogaz\" class=\"hover:bg-slate-50 transition-colors\">\n                  <td class=\"py-3 px-4 text-center font-quran text-2xl font-bold text-emerald-800\">ه</td>\n                  <td class=\"py-3 px-4\"><span class=\"px-2 py-0.5 rounded bg-amber-100 text-amber-800 text-xs font-semibold\">Boğaz</span></td>\n                  <td class=\"py-3 px-4 font-medium text-slate-700\">Boğaz sonu</td>\n                  <td class=\"py-3 px-4 text-slate-600\">\"H\" harfi gibidir.</td>\n                </tr>\n\n                <!-- ى -->\n                <tr data-region=\"dil\" class=\"hover:bg-slate-50 transition-colors\">\n                  <td class=\"py-3 px-4 text-center font-quran text-2xl font-bold text-emerald-800\">ى</td>\n                  <td class=\"py-3 px-4\"><span class=\"px-2 py-0.5 rounded bg-emerald-100 text-emerald-800 text-xs font-semibold\">Dil</span></td>\n                  <td class=\"py-3 px-4 font-medium text-slate-700\">Dil ortası ve üst damak</td>\n                  <td class=\"py-3 px-4 text-slate-600\">\"Y\" harfi gibidir.</td>\n                </tr>\n\n              </tbody>\n            </table>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- SINAV VE DERS İPUCU KUTUSU -->\n    <div class=\"bg-gradient-to-r from-amber-500 via-amber-600 to-orange-500 rounded-3xl p-6 sm:p-8 text-white shadow-lg relative overflow-hidden\">\n      <div class=\"absolute -right-8 -bottom-8 opacity-15 text-white text-9xl\">\n        <i class=\"fa-solid fa-lightbulb\"></i>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"relative z-10 flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-start sm:items-center gap-5\">\n        <div class=\"w-14 h-14 rounded-2xl bg-white/20 backdrop-blur-md flex items-center justify-center text-3xl shrink-0 border border-white/30\">\n          💡\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"space-y-1\">\n          <h3 class=\"text-xl font-extrabold tracking-tight\">Akılda Kalıcı Püf Noktalar</h3>\n          <ul class=\"text-amber-50 text-sm space-y-1.5 list-disc list-inside\">\n            <li><strong>Peltekler 3 tanedir:</strong> <span class=\"font-quran text-base\">ث , ذ , ظ</span> (İkisi ince: <span class=\"font-quran\">ث, ذ</span>, biri kalın: <span class=\"font-quran\">ظ</span>).</li>\n            <li><strong>Kalın harfler 7 tanedir:</strong> <span class=\"font-quran text-base\">خ , ص , ض , ط , ظ , غ , ق</span>.</li>\n            <li><strong>Lâmelif (لا)</strong> ayrı bir harf sayılmaz; <strong>Lâm + Elif</strong> birleşimidir.</li>\n            <li><strong>Mahreç</strong> harfin ses yolundan çıktığı yerdir; harfin yanlış mahreçten okunması <strong>kelimenin anlamını bozar</strong>.</li>\n          </ul>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n  </main>\n\n  <!-- Mini İnteraktif Filtreleme Scripti -->\n  <script>\n    function filterTable(region) {\n      const rows = document.querySelectorAll('#table-body tr');\n      const buttons = document.querySelectorAll('.tab-btn');\n\n      // Aktif buton stilini güncelle\n      buttons.forEach(btn => btn.classList.remove('active', 'bg-emerald-700', 'text-white'));\n      buttons.forEach(btn => btn.classList.add('text-slate-600'));\n\n      const activeBtn = document.getElementById('btn-' + region);\n      if (activeBtn) {\n        activeBtn.classList.add('active');\n        activeBtn.classList.remove('text-slate-600');\n      }\n\n      // Satırları filtrele\n      rows.forEach(row => {\n        if (region === 'all' || row.getAttribute('data-region') === region) {\n          row.style.display = '';\n        } else {\n          row.style.display = 'none';\n        }\n      });\n    }\n  </script>\n\n</body>\n</html>",
